    "SYNTHETIC TEST FIXTURE. Not real odds, and never read by any production",
    "path — only tests/collective/oddsblaze_normalize.test.mjs imports it.",
    "",
    "Shaped after the OddsBlaze Odds endpoint response documented at",
    "docs.oddsblaze.com: a top level `updated`, `league`, `sportsbook`, and an",
    "`events` array whose entries carry `id`, `teams.home` / `teams.away`",
    "(`id`, `name`, `abbreviation`), `date`, `live`, and an `odds` array of",
    "`{ id, market, name, price, main, selection: { name, side, line } }`.",
    "",
    "The second book below deliberately uses the flat variants (a string",
    "`selection`, a `points` field) so the adapter's field fallbacks are",
    "exercised, and the third event contains rows that must NOT be mapped:",
    "a player prop, a market we do not recognise, and an impossible price."
